<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA sorghum export sales highlights in latest report week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 82,800 MT were down 31 percent from the prior week and the 4-week average.  The major buyers were Mexico (50,200 MT) and Japan (35,800 MT). Decreases were reported for unknown destinations (12,000 MT) and Chile (3,500 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 128,600 MT were two and one-tenth times the previous week and 38 percent over the 4-week average.  The primary destinations were Japan (74,800 MT) and Mexico (36,500 MT</p>
</text>
